==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Rarely aggressive, but are usually faster than a horse while walking and sometimes even faster when running.<br>
Take care when fighting mammoths - especially on horses, as after >70% openings they can use an ability similar to "[[Hearth Magic|Raw Hide!]]" and stun nearby horses. This can quickly cause you to get knocked down.<!--Will [[execute]] you if they KO you. (Disabled, see Talk page)-->

